@model Fanex.Affiliate.Admin.Core.DTO.Email.EmailBase
<div>
    Dear valued Affiliate,<br /><br />

    Congratulations, you are now a valued @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) Affiliate member!<br /><br />

    To assist us in serving you better please update any latest change in your personal details and  include your  additional URL (if any) in "My Account" at our @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) Affiliate site.<br /><br />
    Kindly notify us by e-mail to <a href="mailto:@Model.MailContact">@Model.MailContact</a> the exact website URL or URLs you are planning to put up @(Model.SiteFriendlyName)’s banners. If there is a need for different sizes banners, kindly contact us and we will arrange them soonest for you.<br /><br />

    Please be informed that your affiliate account may be subjected to closure if @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) banners have not been put up on your registered website or any notified URL within seven days from your affiliate membership approval unless you have given prior written explanation to @(Model.SiteFriendlyName).<br /><br />

    We wish you all the best and may your web traffic bring forth great profits to you!<br /><br />

    Thank you.<br /><br />

    Regards,<br /><br />

    Your @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) Affiliates Team<br />
    <a href="mailto:@Model.MailContact">@Model.MailContact</a>
</div>